knight demon~
the Demon Knight~
A large demon knight stands before you looking for his next victim.
~
You are so repulsed by his looks that you almost cannot bear to look at him
He is a decaying corpse, with pieces of putrid flesh hanging loosely from his
body. There is blood dripping from many parts of him. You gaze into his
demonic eyes, and you realize that he most certainly means to kill you. The
Demon Knight grins at you with a satanic grin.
~
