indiana indy jones~
Indiana Jones~
Indiana Jones stands here ready for action.
~
He stands up from a kneeling position, and turns around to face you. He is a
man of about six feet in height, and a medium build. He looks a little rough,
since he hasn't shaved in a couple of days. He has a bullwhip in one hand, and
a glowing golden idol in the other. He is wearing a leather jacket that is
is quite old and dirty. His hat also has that same much-used look about it. He
looks at you but does not say anything.
~
